{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type InfiniteQueryExecuteOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey, TPageParam> = Omit<QueryExecuteOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, InfiniteData<TQueryFnData, TPageParam>, TQueryKey, TPageParam>, \"initialPageParam\"> & InitialPageParam<TPageParam> & InfiniteQueryPages<TQueryFnData, TPageParam>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L819","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/query-core/src/types.ts:819"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The options of "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryClient.infiniteQuery"},{"type":"text","value":": like "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/QueryExecuteOptions.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"QueryExecuteOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":", with the\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"initialPageParam"},{"type":"text","value":", and optionally "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"pages"},{"type":"text","value":" together with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"getNextPageParam"},{"type":"text","value":" to fetch that many\npages at once."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tqueryfndata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryFnData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"terror","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TError"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TError"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"DefaultError.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"DefaultError"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/InfiniteData.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"InfiniteData"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryFnData"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tquerykey","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQueryKey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQueryKey"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"QueryKey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryKey"}]},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"link","href":"QueryKey.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryKey"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tpageparam","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TPageParam"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TPageParam"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tqueryfndata","text":"TQueryFnData","level":3},{"id":"terror","text":"TError","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"tquerykey","text":"TQueryKey","level":3},{"id":"tpageparam","text":"TPageParam","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype InfiniteQueryExecuteOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey, TPageParam> = Omit<QueryExecuteOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, InfiniteData<TQueryFnData, TPageParam>, TQueryKey, TPageParam>, \"initialPageParam\"> & InitialPageParam<TPageParam> & InfiniteQueryPages<TQueryFnData, TPageParam>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/types.ts:819](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L819)\n\nThe options of `queryClient.infiniteQuery`: like [QueryExecuteOptions](../interfaces/QueryExecuteOptions.md), with the\n`initialPageParam`, and optionally `pages` together with `getNextPageParam` to fetch that many\npages at once.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = [`InfiniteData`](../interfaces/InfiniteData.md)\\<`TQueryFnData`\\>\n\n### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md) = [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md)\n\n### TPageParam\n\n`TPageParam` = `unknown`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: InfiniteQueryExecuteOptions\ntitle: InfiniteQueryExecuteOptions\n---\n\n```ts\ntype InfiniteQueryExecuteOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, TQueryKey, TPageParam> = Omit<QueryExecuteOptions<TQueryFnData, TError, TData, InfiniteData<TQueryFnData, TPageParam>, TQueryKey, TPageParam>, \"initialPageParam\"> & InitialPageParam<TPageParam> & InfiniteQueryPages<TQueryFnData, TPageParam>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/types.ts:819](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L819)\n\nThe options of `queryClient.infiniteQuery`: like [QueryExecuteOptions](../interfaces/QueryExecuteOptions.md), with the\n`initialPageParam`, and optionally `pages` together with `getNextPageParam` to fetch that many\npages at once.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TQueryFnData\n\n`TQueryFnData` = `unknown`\n\n### TError\n\n`TError` = [`DefaultError`](DefaultError.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` = [`InfiniteData`](../interfaces/InfiniteData.md)\\<`TQueryFnData`\\>\n\n### TQueryKey\n\n`TQueryKey` *extends* [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md) = [`QueryKey`](QueryKey.md)\n\n### TPageParam\n\n`TPageParam` = `unknown`\n"}
